      "value": "[auto-routed: surprise=1.00] Implement the family function that generates rigid constraint families (affine-invariant) and fat constraint families (non-invariant) for the capacity scan experiment. The function must return properly shaped (N,1) arrays with O(1) normalized outputs to satisfy the zero-violation criterion. This enables testing the hypothesis about topological invariance under affine transformations."
